673	//! carries `kind` or `media` (`actions.rs`'s `OBJECT_DISCRIMINANTS`), and
674	//! none sits in a list, so `lerp_at` always walks to each colour (depth
675	//! ≤ 4, under `MAX_PATCH_DEPTH`) and the value overwritten here is that
676	//! walk's, never a whole object held at its start.
